{"id":4901,"date":"2026-02-18T16:28:12","date_gmt":"2026-02-18T15:28:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/venol.de\/?p=4901"},"modified":"2026-05-08T14:31:47","modified_gmt":"2026-05-08T12:31:47","slug":"istanbul-2025","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/venol.de\/pl\/istanbul-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Istanbul 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-mowvzvms-d59761c0cf4594251705d36004b08739\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-mowvzvms-d59761c0cf4594251705d36004b08739{\npadding-bottom:0;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-mowvzvms-d59761c0cf4594251705d36004b08739 .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-mowvzvms-d59761c0cf4594251705d36004b08739 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-mowvzvms-d59761c0cf4594251705d36004b08739 .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-mowvzvms-d59761c0cf4594251705d36004b08739 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-mowvzvms-d59761c0cf4594251705d36004b08739 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-mowvzvms-d59761c0cf4594251705d36004b08739 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-0  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Istanbul 2025<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-6u1p8l-7045cd359f79a7c7f529b4947ba913e8\">\n#top .hr.av-6u1p8l-7045cd359f79a7c7f529b4947ba913e8{\nmargin-top:0;\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-6u1p8l-7045cd359f79a7c7f529b4947ba913e8 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-6u1p8l-7045cd359f79a7c7f529b4947ba913e8 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-6dkun9-57e422385e37ff16889ea326648b1110 sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-6dkun9-57e422385e37ff16889ea326648b1110 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-moww0fye-65719cdbecb5b6f59dd12fa1558fbc8f '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p class=\"has-ast-global-color-2-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-fb9f385cbed61bfae3ef20aad03bba5f\">Z rado\u015bci\u0105 informujemy, \u017ce jako firma Venol b\u0119dziemy obecni na presti\u017cowych targach Automechanika Istanbule!<\/p>\n<p class=\"has-ast-global-color-2-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-e8fe55cf39d8cbdeb20234822dc22538\">Na naszym stoisku czeka na Was:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"has-ast-global-color-2-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-e8fe55cf39d8cbdeb20234822dc22538\">Pe\u0142na oferta olej\u00f3w oraz dodatk\u00f3w do paliw i olej\u00f3w<\/li>\n<li class=\"has-ast-global-color-2-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-e8fe55cf39d8cbdeb20234822dc22538\">Eksperci, kt\u00f3rzy ch\u0119tnie podziel\u0105 si\u0119 wiedz\u0105 i odpowiedz\u0105 na Wasze pytania<\/li>\n<li class=\"has-ast-global-color-2-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-e8fe55cf39d8cbdeb20234822dc22538\">Aromatyczna kawa, idealna na biznesowe rozmowy<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"has-ast-global-color-2-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-c530b10e0d7c622bf0327942191a3515\">Nie mo\u017cemy si\u0119 doczeka\u0107 spotkania z Wami &#8211; do zobaczenia w Stambule!<\/p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">Chcieliby\u015bmy serdecznie podzi\u0119kowa\u0107\u00a0<strong>Centrum Obs\u0142ugi Przedsi\u0119biorcy<\/strong>\u00a0za wsparcie udzielone naszej marce\u00a0VENOL w ramach udzia\u0142u w targach mi\u0119dzynarodowych.<\/p>\n<p>Otrzymane dofinansowanie w ramach projektu\u00a0<strong>FELD.01.05-IP.02-0675\/24 \u2013 \u201ePromocja polskich olej\u00f3w silnikowych poprzez udzia\u0142 w targach mi\u0119dzynarodowych\u201d<\/strong>\u00a0umo\u017cliwi\u0142o nam skuteczn\u0105 promocj\u0119 polskich produkt\u00f3w na rynkach zagranicznych oraz znacz\u0105co przyczyni\u0142o si\u0119 do zwi\u0119kszenia rozpoznawalno\u015bci marki VENOL.<\/p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">Dzi\u0119kujemy za zaufanie, profesjonalne podej\u015bcie oraz realne wsparcie w rozwoju polskiego biznesu poza granicami kraju.<\/p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">Wsp\u00f3\u0142praca z Centrum Obs\u0142ugi Przedsi\u0119biorcy stanowi dla nas wa\u017cny krok w dalszej ekspansji mi\u0119dzynarodowej oraz budowaniu silnej pozycji marki VENOL na rynku globalnym.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div>\n<div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-4jtivp-e077e231278290ab7dca24fa3c16f552 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-4  el_after_av_one_half  el_before_av_one_half  flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-moww0x5l-908b65194673748b2e6d793dbc135757\">\n.avia-image-container.av-moww0x5l-908b65194673748b2e6d793dbc135757 img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-moww0x5l-908b65194673748b2e6d793dbc135757 .av-image-caption-overlay-center{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-image-container av-moww0x5l-908b65194673748b2e6d793dbc135757 av-styling- avia-align-center  avia-builder-el-5  avia-builder-el-no-sib